physicalRef: mfs_links
description: "Mobile financial services fraud Link Analysis showcase - ONE link Dataset built by the mfs_links Job from wallet, agent, merchant, wallet_txn, sim_event and device_login. kind is one of registered_by, paid, cashed_in_at, cashed_out_at, logged_in_on, swapped_by, settles_to; one row per pair; via names the evidence. Ids say what an endpoint is: WL- wallet, A- agent, MR- merchant, HS- handset, S- staff login, BA- bank account. Synthetic."
